  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low-Income Housing Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Vivienda Sector Bajos Ingresos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POSIBLE AREAS OF INTERVENTION FOR IDB: (I) SUPPORT GOVERNMENT DEVELOP ITS HOUSING POLICIES AND FRAMEWORK, THAT ESTABLISHES PRIORITIES AND CRITIERIA FOR THE DIFFERENT ACTORS IN THE SECTOR (PUBLIC, INTERNATIONAL AND NGO; (II) SEEK COORDINATION AMONG IMPORTANT BILATERAL AGENCIAS; (III) MOBILIZE BILATERAL AND DOMESTIC FUNDS; AND (IV) IMPROVE EFFICIENT USE OF PUBLIC FUNDS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
